      ],
      "content": "TRING RURAL            STATION ROAD SP 8915                                         (West side)                                         Long Marston 8/143                                   No. 9 -                                       (Old Thatch) GV                                         II House. C16, altered in C17. Timber frame with painted brick infill (some in herringbone pattern) and steep thatched roof. A 1½ storeys house facing N set back from road, with 2 equal bays, large external chimney at W gable, and small internal E gable chimney. 2 windows front with door into LH room. 3-light C19 flush casement windows and plank door. Exposed frame has jowled posts, mid-height rail, widely-spaced studs, thin straight tension braces above rail at corners, and clasped-purlin roof with collar. 2 recessed dormers at eaves. The front windows cut through the mid-height rail and suggest the floor was inserted into a formerly single storey house. Listing NGR: SP8967015700"
    }
